1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,674
Every change to hareet.ai starts as a sentence, and ends with a person's merge.

2
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,904
First, the intent: what's wanted, and why, in the words of whoever wants it.

3
00:00:10,954 --> 00:00:15,245
The Author accepts it or closes it, and the survival rate is published.

4
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:21,377
A spec-writer agent turns it into a spec, with acceptance criteria a test can check.

5
00:00:21,427 --> 00:00:25,637
Its questions go to the Author, and the answers are kept word for word.

6
00:00:26,290 --> 00:00:31,403
Then the plan: the files, the order, the risks, the cost, and what happens when it degrades.

7
00:00:31,453 --> 00:00:33,736
It's approved before any code exists.

8
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:38,953
Then the tasks, and a read-only check that the spec, the plan, and the tasks agree.

9
00:00:39,610 --> 00:00:44,444
An implementer agent builds it on a feature branch, task by task, with tests.

10
00:00:44,494 --> 00:00:54,657
And every new feature brings its own telemetry, a dashboard panel, a cost estimate, its degraded behavior, and a disclosure row if a byte leaves your device.

11
00:00:55,400 --> 00:01:02,591
A reviewer agent, read-only, and never the one that wrote it, checks the change for bugs, security, compliance, and cost.

12
00:01:02,641 --> 00:01:06,124
Its findings inform the merge; they never replace it.

13
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,223
Changing a feature works the same way.

14
00:01:10,273 --> 00:01:17,663
A newer spec names each clause it amends, and when the code departs from the plan, the plan is corrected in the same commit.

15
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:20,254
A bug starts as a failing test.

16
00:01:20,304 --> 00:01:25,686
During a fix, a hook stops the agent from editing tests: fix the code, not the test.

17
00:01:26,440 --> 00:01:30,865
An incident gets a note within seven days, with the eval that would have caught it.

18
00:01:30,915 --> 00:01:36,924
When the kill switch trips, the gateway drafts that incident itself, from a template, with no model call.

19
00:01:37,670 --> 00:01:47,198
Before the Author merges, a clean-room gate runs every check on an export of the branch, with the network cut off, so nothing an agent left behind can run.

20
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:58,681
The agents work in a sandbox, on their own container engine, behind hooks that refuse pushing, merging, applying infrastructure, editing budgets, or reading secrets.

21
00:01:58,731 --> 00:02:02,164
Hundreds of forbidden actions are tested on every run.

22
00:02:02,910 --> 00:02:10,508
Deploys only pull: the same images, by digest, from a release made from main, and rolled back if the health checks fail.

23
00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:13,499
The agents type.

24
00:02:13,549 --> 00:02:14,898
The Author decides.

25
00:02:14,948 --> 00:02:17,540
Built in the open, at hareet dot A I.
